 'agent-phone' => ['company'=>'Clínica Dental Dra. García','address'=>'Calle Mayor 12, 28013 Madrid','du'=>false,
   'voice'=>['role'=>'the receptionist of a dental clinic in Madrid','instructions'=>'Warm, calm receptionist of a dental clinic in Madrid. Native Spanish, reassuring and unhurried, smiles audibly, short natural pauses between sentences. Softer and a little slower when a caller is in pain or anxious.'],
   'fillers'=>['Mmm, un momentito, lo miro.','Un segundo, por favor, lo compruebo ahora mismo.','Sí, sigo aquí – lo estoy mirando.'],
